{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ce1924bb-9435-45cc-be94-2b46e2cccf17",
    "name": "ACMS - Part I Management reports",
    "description": "Run in order with the ACMS-Local environment. Needs the registrar, Finance Officer, farmer, Field Officer and District Agronomist accounts (ownFarmerId and the two staff in ownDistrictId) and officerUserId. Run Part G before I19. Each run creates its own season, so it can be run again.",
